  "code": "<button> Button\n  <span></span>\n</button>\n<style>\n/* From Uiverse.io by adamgiebl - Tags: button */\nbutton {\n  border: none;\n  display: block;\n  position: relative;\n  padding: 0.7em 2.4em;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  user-select: none;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: royalblue;\n  z-index: 1;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\nbutton span {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  top: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: transparent;\n  z-index: -1;\n  border: 4px solid royalblue;\n}\n\nbutton span::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  display: block;\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 8%;\n  height: 500%;\n  background: var(--lightgray);\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-60deg);\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover span::before {\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-90deg);\n  width: 100%;\n  background: royalblue;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  color: white;\n}\n\nbutton:active span::before {\n  background: #2751cd;\n}\n</style>",
